    {
      "id": "p5-code",
      "eyebrow": "眼见为实",
      "title": "最小 harness 长这样",
      "content": {
        "kind": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "lines": [
          {
            "code": "while not done:",
            "comment": "循环 → 你写",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "    resp = llm(messages)",
            "comment": "决策 → LLM",
            "highlight": "llm"
          },
          {
            "code": "    cmd = parse(resp)",
            "comment": "解析 → 你写",
            "highlight": "harness"
          },
          {
            "code": "    result = execute(cmd)",
            "comment": "执行 → 你写",
            "highlight": "harness"
          },
          {
            "code": "    messages.append(result)",
            "comment": "反馈 → 你写",
            "highlight": "harness"
          },
          {
            "code": "    done = check(result)",
            "comment": "终止 → 你写",
            "highlight": "harness"
          }
        ],
        "note": "五行里只有一行是 LLM，其余四行全是 harness。一个 agent 项目约 80% 的代码其实在写 harness"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "我们看代码。一个最小的 harness 就是这个 while 循环。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-01/p5-code-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "LLM 负责决策，输出想干什么。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-01/p5-code-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "你写的部分负责解析它说了什么、真的去执行、把结果塞回对话、并判断什么时候停。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-01/p5-code-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "注意看：五行里只有一行是模型，其余四行都是你写的。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-01/p5-code-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "这就是为什么说 agent 项目百分之八十的代码其实在写 harness。",
          "audio": "audio/harness-01/p5-code-s4.mp3"
        }
      ],
